-#
-#  The other side as a line of a description cell, for a table whose party
-#  column is hidden (Fin::CamtParty). A label, such as a batch payment's,
-#  names no one and is left out.
-#
-#  Locals: party, kind (party_kind), amount (signed)
- if party.present? && kind != "label"
  %div
    %span.fw-light.muted Gegenseite:
    %span= fin_party_cell(party, kind, amount)
